{"key": "[\"On 26 August 1303, seven months after leaving Delhi, Alauddin Khalji enters Chittor. Amir Khusrau, who marched with the army, writes that the Sultan ordered some thirty thousand people killed. The story of Padmini comes from a poem written two centuries later. The writers of the time do not mention her.\", \"sarvam:varun_en_suspense@en-IN\", \"+6%\", \"+0Hz\", {}, \"fx5\"]", "mp3": "/Users/saidevdhal/Desktop/Codes/indianepics/public/audio/en/alauddin-chittor-1303.mp3", "duration": 19.660875, "words": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "On"}, {"t": 0.3855073529411765, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "26"}, {"t": 0.771014705882353, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "August"}, {"t": 1.1565220588235294, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "1303,"}, {"t": 1.542029411764706, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "seven"}, {"t": 1.9275367647058825, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "months"}, {"t": 2.313044117647059, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "after"}, {"t": 2.6985514705882356, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "leaving"}, {"t": 3.084058823529412, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Delhi,"}, {"t": 3.4695661764705883, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Alauddin"}, {"t": 3.855073529411765, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Khalji"}, {"t": 4.240580882352941, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "enters"}, {"t": 4.626088235294118, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Chittor."}, {"t": 5.011595588235294, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Amir"}, {"t": 5.397102941176471, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "Khusrau,"}, {"t": 5.782610294117648, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "who"}, {"t": 6.168117647058824, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "marched"}, {"t": 6.553625, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "with"}, {"t": 6.939132352941177, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "the"}, {"t": 7.324639705882354, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "army,"}, {"t": 7.71014705882353, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "writes"}, {"t": 8.095654411764706, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "that"}, {"t": 8.481161764705883, "d": 0.3855073529411765, "w": "the"}, {